{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The hose clamps felt closest to my interests because they secure things mechanically, which connects to my recent washers, nuts and bolts.",
    "The practical repair supplies fit part of my hardware interests, although that connection alone does not give me a reason to buy them now."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Wire connectors and heat shrink tubing assume I am doing electrical work, but my recent purchases were for fastening and hanging things.",
    "The antenna analyzer serves a specialized purpose I have shown no interest in, while the exam gloves have little connection to my recent needs.",
    "The large glue refill and ten-pack require a specific use and quantity need that I do not currently have."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My interest in hardware seems to have been stretched into an interest in electrical repair supplies.",
    "Buying assortments of fasteners seems to have been taken as a reason to recommend large quantities of other supplies, even when their uses are different."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My recent magnetic hooks and fasteners point more clearly toward hanging, securing and assembling things than toward wiring work.",
    "I rarely interact without a relevant need; even the hose clamps would only interest me when their specific size fits a task."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "You recognized my practical hardware interests but assumed electrical projects and bulk supply needs that my recent activity does not support."
}"}
